    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Deceptively Spacious Own-Door Ground Floor Apartment in a Highly Convenient Location\r\n\r\nRedmond Property is delighted to present 30 Holywell Way to the market, a deceptively spacious, self-contained ground floor apartment ideally situated within the ever-popular Holywell development, just off Feltrim Road in Swords.\r\n\r\nThe property benefits from its own private entrance and offers well-proportioned accommodation together with a small private balcony, making it an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, downsizers or investors seeking a conveniently located property close to a host of amenities.\r\n\r\nFeatures include natural gas fired central heating, double-glazed uPVC windows and communal on-street car parking within the development.\r\n\r\nLOCATION\r\n\r\nHolywell is a well-established and highly popular residential development enjoying an exceptionally convenient location. A good selection of everyday amenities is available locally, including shops, schools, childcare facilities and recreational amenities.\r\n\r\nThe property is within easy reach of Swords Town Centre and the Pavilions Shopping Centre, while Airside Retail Park provides an extensive range of major retailers and services. Dublin Airport is also only a short distance away.\r\n\r\nFor commuters, Holywell offers excellent connectivity. The M1 motorway is readily accessible, providing convenient access to the M50, Dublin City Centre and the wider motorway network. The area is also well served by public transport, with Dublin Bus and Swords Express services providing connections towards Swords, Dublin Airport and Dublin City Centre.\r\n\r\nWith Swords Town Centre, Airside, Dublin Airport and the M1 all close at hand, 30 Holywell Way combines comfortable apartment living with an exceptionally convenient North Dublin location."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "(Please refer to floor plan for room measurements)\r\n\r\nEntrance lobby with hardwood front door, laminate wood floor, alarm panel\r\n\r\nLiving room / dining room laminate wood floor, feature mock fireplace, gas boiler, blinds, wall panelling, t.v. point\r\n\r\nKitchen with wall / floor units, worktop space, washing machine, dishwasher, fridge/freezer, oven/hob/extractor fan, laminate wood floor\r\n\r\nRear Hallway with hot press\r\n\r\nBathroom with w.c., w.h.b., bath, tiled floor, extractor fan\r\n\r\nBedroom (1) built-in wardrobes, carpet, t.v. point, door with access to balcony\r\nEn-Suite with w.c., w.h.b., shower cubicle, fully tiled, cabinet, chrome fittings\r\n\r\nBedroom (2) built-in wardrobes, blind, carpet"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Deceptively spacious ground floor apartment\r\nSelf-contained with own-door entrance\r\nPopular Holywell development off Feltrim Road\r\nNatural gas fired central heating\r\nDouble-glazed uPVC windows\r\nSmall private balcony\r\nCommunal on-street car parking\r\nClose to local shops, schools and amenities\r\nEasy access to Swords Town Centre and Pavilions Shopping Centre\r\nAirside Retail Park nearby\r\nConvenient to Dublin Airport\r\nExcellent access to M1 and M50\r\nWell served by Dublin Bus and Swords Express\r\nIdeal for first-time buyers, downsizers or investors\r\nAnnual Service Charge E1,329.56 per annum"
      },
